---

This project is a graphical interface built on top of llmfit
(https://github.com/AlexsJones/llmfit), Copyright (c) Alex Jones, also
MIT licensed.

llmfit provides the hardware detection, the model catalogue and the
fit/speed estimation engine. This repository does not include or
redistribute llmfit's source code: it is consumed as a dependency from
PyPI at runtime. See the upstream project for its own licence terms.
